    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Doors Moor Doors</strong> is a puzzle-adventure game set in a mysterious underground facility filled with countless doors. Your mission is simple: escape. But finding your way out won't be easy. You'll need to search for items, solve puzzles, and make your way through complex environments, each with its own set of challenges. The game offers a variety of doors to unlock, each leading to new surprises or obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an underground facility with countless doors. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to unlock doors and solve puzzles. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter entities that can help you escape or not. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of puzzles with different difficulty levels. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized item locations and enemy locations for replayability. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and time while evading threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door opens to new corridors, identical and repetitive, blurring the lines between reality and madness. The deeper you go, the more unsettling the atmosphere becomes\u2014subtle sounds echo from unseen spaces, flickering lights play tricks on your mind, and you start to question if you\u2019re truly alone. Each step forward feels like a descent into the depths of your own psyche, making Doors Moor Doors not just a game, but a surreal endurance test.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Doors Moor Doors</strong> is a puzzle-adventure game set in a mysterious underground facility filled with countless doors. Your mission is simple: escape. But finding your way out won't be easy. You'll need to search for items, solve puzzles, and make your way through complex environments, each with its own set of challenges. The game offers a variety of doors to unlock, each leading to new surprises or obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an underground facility with countless doors. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to unlock doors and solve puzzles. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter entities that can help you escape or not. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of puzzles with different difficulty levels. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized item locations and enemy locations for replayability. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and time while evading threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door opens to new corridors, identical and repetitive, blurring the lines between reality and madness. The deeper you go, the more unsettling the atmosphere becomes\u2014subtle sounds echo from unseen spaces, flickering lights play tricks on your mind, and you start to question if you\u2019re truly alone. Each step forward feels like a descent into the depths of your own psyche, making Doors Moor Doors not just a game, but a surreal endurance test.</p></li></ul>",
